Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 10:13:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 41/64] CoD hipfire cone + click-fire for pistols/bolt/semi.

Floor standing-still hip spread and require release between shots on
non-autos so MP40-class weapons stay hold-to-spray.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
